  "headBody": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Best way to back up notes? - Example Forum</title>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Best way to back up notes?\"></head><body>\n<div id=\"main-outlet\"><h1 class=\"topic-title\">Best way to back up notes?</h1>\n<div class=\"topic-post\" id=\"post_1\" data-post-id=\"1\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"username\">kestrel</span> <time>2 days ago</time></div>\n<div class=\"cooked\"><p>I keep my notes as plain markdown files. What is the least painful way to back them up off-site?</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"topic-post\" id=\"post_2\" data-post-id=\"2\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"username\">pomelo</span></div>\n<div class=\"cooked\"><aside class=\"quote\" data-username=\"kestrel\"><blockquote><p>least painful way</p></blockquote></aside><p>Use an encrypted sync. Anything else is a chore you will skip.</p><ul><li>test restores</li><li>keep two copies</li></ul></div></div>\n<div class=\"topic-post\" id=\"post_3\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"username\">anon</span></div><div class=\"cooked\"><p>+1 to the above.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"topic-footer-buttons\"><button class=\"btn reply\">Reply</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"suggested-topics\"><h3>Suggested</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/t/1\">Sync conflicts</a></li></ul></div>\n</body></html>\n"
